Automatic Country & Region Detection:
When a visitor opens the site, 

geo.js
 detects their country and timezone (e.g. 🇬🇧 United Kingdom, 🇮🇳 India, 🇺🇸 USA, etc.).
Detected Region Live Banner:
A pulsing badge appears right above the form:
📍 Detected Region: United Kingdom (London) • Routing to local practice team

Smart Phone Input with Country Flag & Code:
The phone number input automatically pre-selects the visitor's local dial code (e.g., 🇬🇧 +44 for UK, 🇮🇳 +91 for India).
Visitors can also click the flag to choose any other country code from the dropdown.
Tailored Confirmation Message:
On submission, the confirmation message dynamically mentions their country (e.g., "Our United Kingdom immigration practice specialists will contact you...").
